  "That is right. Grandmothers on every continent say it because they saw it happen: {X}, then {Y}. Warm feet, warm health.",
  "Absolutely. The blood runs from the feet to the rest of you, and it carries the chill with it, which is how {Y} starts. It is the oldest household rule for a reason.",
